WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.362
Start at the weekly headline dashboard.

00:00:02.362 --> 00:00:04.884
The dates show the saved reporting period.

00:00:04.884 --> 00:00:08.848
Catalog additions are newly captured here, not necessarily newly launched products.

00:00:08.848 --> 00:00:11.731
Click a number to see its matching products.

00:00:11.731 --> 00:00:14.614
Open Weekly highlights for examples and source links.

00:00:14.614 --> 00:00:17.857
Current trend evidence is separate from this week’s changes.

00:00:17.857 --> 00:00:21.100
The dashboard refreshes from the saved catalog each week.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.654
Choose a retailer to browse its own assortment.

00:00:24.654 --> 00:00:28.579
Then select a brand, or search for a product or character.

00:00:28.579 --> 00:00:32.503
Selecting another shop starts a fresh browse and clears conflicting filters.

00:00:32.503 --> 00:00:36.071
Each card shows the shop, currency, pack and available details.

00:00:36.071 --> 00:00:40.353
A price from an international store is not a mainland China price.

00:00:40.353 --> 00:00:42.850
Use Full product details to investigate further.

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:47.750
Inside product details, check the description, material, size and available design options.

00:00:47.750 --> 00:00:53.700
Expand the shop’s listed options to distinguish one random box, a full set and a named character.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:58.250
Check the observation date, then follow the original shop link for current availability.

00:00:58.250 --> 00:01:01.400
A series photo does not guarantee every design pictured.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.600
Missing facts stay out of the main details; source warnings remain visible.

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:09.817
Use Select for comparison on two to six product cards.

00:01:09.817 --> 00:01:12.631
You can keep selecting across brands or shops.

00:01:12.631 --> 00:01:13.686
Then press Compare.

00:01:13.686 --> 00:01:17.554
The table puts the photos and available details side by side.

00:01:17.554 --> 00:01:21.071
Use each product’s option menu to choose the exact pack.

00:01:21.071 --> 00:01:24.940
Compare the same currency and pack basis, and check source dates.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:27.050
There is no automatic best-value claim.

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:33.784
Download comparison C S V exports only your selected offers, with photo links, descriptions, specifications, prices, currencies, variants and source information.

00:01:33.784 --> 00:01:37.520
A C S V is a text file, so it cannot embed photographs.

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:40.393
Open its Image U R L to view the photo.

00:01:40.393 --> 00:01:46.140
Download photo sheet gives you a visual comparison with photos and details; it needs internet to load the linked images.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:51.025
You can open it in a browser and print or save it as a P D F.

00:01:51.725 --> 00:01:57.657
Close the comparison and use Download C S V in the header to export the current filtered results.

00:01:57.657 --> 00:02:03.259
Full C S V in the footer exports the entire catalog, including photo links and available details.

00:02:03.259 --> 00:02:05.895
For popularity, open Source audit and market analysis.

00:02:05.895 --> 00:02:08.532
Revenue, growth and platform visibility have different meanings.

00:02:08.532 --> 00:02:13.475
Read the period, market and evidence source before deciding what is relevant to your assortment.
